  "comment": {
    "text": "Item in the actions menu of a knowledge base (its header and its card in the list) in the AI Chat section; opens the form that edits its name, icon and settings. Verb, imperative or the form the language uses for menu commands. Short menu label, no full stop. Knowledge base = a room of files the AI assistant searches; never call it a room. Match Common:CreateKnowledgeBase.",
    "is_auto": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T13:04:52.624Z",
    "model": "claude-fable-5-2"
  },
